---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>BWS — Help Centre Enhancement · Kara</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-neutral-900 antialiased">

    <!-- NAV -->
    <nav class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-10 pb-4">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-16 pb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-7">
        Case Study · 2024
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[64px] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-black mb-10" style="max-width: 1080px;">
        BWS —<br />
        <em class="italic">Help Centre Enhancement</em>
      </h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-16 gap-y-4 text-neutral-900">
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Role</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">UI Designer</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Brand</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">BWS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Teams</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">UX, Product, Engineering, Customer Hub</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <figure class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <img
        src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-hero.png"
        alt="BWS Help Centre Enhancement"
        class="max-w-[947px] w-full h-auto"
      />
    </figure>

    <!-- OUTCOME -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Outcome</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">We had a new Help Centre App design ready, fresh with the BWS brand refresh. In true agile fashion, we pivoted to deliver an MVP: a significantly enhanced Contact Us page for BWS Web — triaging customers to the BWS bot, a contact form, or the contact centre.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Before</p>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-before.png"
            alt="BWS Contact Us page before"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">After</p>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-after.png"
            alt="BWS Contact Us page after"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE DILEMMA -->
    <div class="w-full mb-20" style="background: #F0EFEF; padding: 80px 0;">
      <div class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8">
        <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">The dilemma</h2>
        <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
          <p class="mb-0">The help customer journey was not well defined across assets. There was no central help hub — information was cluttered and hard to find, causing confusion and a poor customer experience that drove up contact centre wait times and dissatisfaction.</p>
          <p>Without enough self-service opportunities, customers defaulted to calling the contact centre, reinforcing a behavioural pattern that was costly and hard to break. Customers unable to resolve queries online simply kept calling — compounding the problem.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DISCOVERY -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Discovery</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-16 max-w-[800px] mt-6 mb-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-2">Initiative Kickoff</h3>
          <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[32px] text-black">Refreshed on past work, aligned on scope, and gained consensus on the initiative's focus — surfacing gaps, risks, and dependencies.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-2">Stakeholder Kickoff</h3>
          <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[32px] text-black">Mapped out business processes and rules, generated requirements, and defined metrics and analytics to measure success.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-2">Discovery Workshop</h3>
          <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[32px] text-black">Explored the problem space through user journey mapping, task mapping, and assumption mapping to align the team on what we knew and what we needed to learn.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-workshop.png"
        alt="Discovery workshop"
        class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
      />
    </section>

    <!-- IDEATION & DESIGN -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Ideation &amp; design</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">The UX Designer led idea generation sketching sessions, which were then transformed into low-fidelity wireframes. These formed the basis for customer testing and were handed to me to build out the UI designs.</p>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Idea Sketches</h3>
        <img
          src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-sketches.png"
          alt="Idea generation sketches"
          class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CUSTOMER TESTING -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Customer testing</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">
        <p class="mb-0">To validate the proposed experience, we interviewed 8 participants via Askable, identifying their archetypes as Transactional, Price Focused, and Price Sensitive — the segments making up the most value and volume share.</p>
        <p>Participants had to have purchased from BWS or Dan Murphy's within the last 3 months. We walked them through the current app experience, then asked them to complete 3 tasks using low-fidelity prototypes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Figma Prototype</h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-prototype.png"
            alt="Figma prototype used in testing"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Testing Notes</h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-testing-notes.png"
            alt="Testing notes example"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">After synthesising the interview notes, the UX Designer played back insights to the squad and wider stakeholders, then handed the low-fi wireframes to me to create the UI designs.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Inspiration</h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-inspiration.png"
            alt="Design inspiration"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">UI Playground</h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-ui-playground.png"
            alt="UI playground explorations"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE PIVOT -->
    <div class="w-full mb-20" style="background: #F0EFEF; padding: 80px 0;">
      <div class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8">
        <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Uh oh — time to pivot</h2>
        <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
          <p class="mb-0">Our Android and iOS developers were pulled from the team to work on an urgent project. In true agile style, we pivoted.</p>
          <p>With a new BWS chatbot freshly released, the decision was made to update the Contact Us page instead. This page would act as a triage point for customers to access the BWS bot, fill out a form, or call the contact centre — the three contact avenues that came out clearly from our customer interviews.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WHAT SHIPPED — WEB -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">What shipped</p>
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">BWS Web — Contact Us page enhancement</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">The enhanced Contact Us pages were successfully released, giving customers a clear path to self-serve or reach out via their preferred channel.</p>
      <img
        src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-web.png"
        alt="BWS Web Contact Us page"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
    </section>

    <!-- ALSO DESIGNED — APP -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Also designed</p>
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">BWS App — Help Centre</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-16">The full App Help Centre design was completed and ready — built fresh with the BWS brand refresh — though the pivot meant it was not released during this initiative.</p>
      <img
        src="/case-studies/bws-help-centre/bws-help-centre-app.png"
        alt="BWS App Help Centre design"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-neutral-200">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back to all work
      </a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>